                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-01"><hi rendition="#italic">August 1,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A complete reconciliation between Diaz and Mena took place in my presence
                    to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
